flowchart LR
  C[Fresh console output] --> X[Evidence reconciliation]
  G[Stored known-good configuration] --> X
  T[Current telemetry and topology] --> M{Metric observed in current source?}
  M -->|Yes| V[Expose exact measured value]
  M -->|No| B[Return blank / not collected]
  V --> X
  B --> X
  X --> L[Local access port and VLAN]
  L --> U[Local uplink and LAG]
  U --> R[Reciprocal upstream port]
  R --> D[Downstream dependencies]
  D --> I[Independent service signal]
  I --> O[Fault domain and confidence]
  O --> A[Test, fix, validation, rollback]
